6,First Nation artist Julie Dowling | The Art Gallery of Western Australia,https://artgallery.wa.gov.au/discover/agwa-reading-room/first-nation-artist-julie-dowling,Badimaya culture is also land specific as it relates to a place and an environment and without those two/three things acting in unison…language/place/cultural practice then it’s very difficult...,Badimaya,Australian
